"карету."

#: scenario3:scenario3_0188FDA6_E178_40AB_9137_0037D28147C0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 76d6d8769a9a7ef79e3377cd233d945ce403ea34a08aef0dc87edebc78707981
