msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_760B185E_C12A_48D4_972D_8BF371762487"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eventually, the speed at which they danced began to slow—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫as if they were resting "
"their legs."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Со временем, скорость, с которой они танцевали, начала замедляться—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫словно они "
"решили передохнуть."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DCB841CA_6ABA_4CE0_8B81_E605256FE00F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5b46a2e172930c3be3043e57c5c7b484466bbde0ebdf1e0b2bfefb28b8b5cf58
#. default-sha256: 0b133538455e3b971d0beb57dc0384a677e2cfb7d0b0dfc248692e7278576ed0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DCB841CA_6ABA_4CE0_8B81_E605256FE00F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I almost thought I could hear the sound of their feet with each step."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫И мне казалось, будто я слышу отзвук каждого их шага."

#: scenario3:scenario3_23F9237C_5344_43A8_964A_BC380BC82D60
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cb3a6688cddb4ccd678d98de18d6411541857474428d9428a9b62a1661ce86eb
