#: scenario3:scenario3_0C761822_45C3_4A2E_8B67_DB0ABEAC218D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a740a4f4a77c498c43929382f4ccdae80a55bb1a0617eb0837598d8da8a32a14
